  "description": "My life... Where did it all go wrong?  \nIn this short life, I can't blame others,  \nJust tumbling and rolling through various ups and downs,  \nA man, 'Seong Ji-hwan,' who faced a futile death, worn out by stress.\n\nFortunately (or unfortunately?), he was reborn as the protagonist of the cliché 'rebirth' genre...  \nHuh? My boring reality remains the same!?  \nAll I can do is 'not do' anything!\n\nIt can't be helped,  \nAt least, I'll cut ties with the trash that only hindered my life!  \nIt may be too trivial to call it a superpower...  \nCan this alone change my life?\n\n\"We were dirty together, but let's not meet again in this life!\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62942255), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%82%98%EC%9D%98-%EC%86%90%EC%A0%88%EC%9D%BC%EC%A7%80/3772)",
